#, php-format
msgid "On your <a href=\"%s\" %s>profile page</a> series are also combined with photos. This allowed us to get rid of the \"Photos Weddings Photo shoots Interview\" submenu and made the navigation easier. You can change the order of series and photos in your portfolio by simply dragging and dropping them."
