msgid "Hi %1$s,\n\n"
"MyWed honestly believes that you are a prolific and talented member of our community. To thank you for your amazing shots, we have upgraded your account membership to a new Pro+ subscription plan.\n\n"
"Now your portfolio will take the top position in the directory. What's more, you are free to upload %2$s photos per week and %3$s stories per month. To discover other advantages of the Pro+ plan, visit the page: %4$s\n\n"
"Thank you for being with us, and keep up the good work!"
